<title>NETHERLANDS: Gist-Brocades acquires US dairy business.</title>
<headline>Gist-Brocades acquires US dairy business.</headline>
<dateline>DELFT, Netherlands 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch biochemicals and food group Gist-Brocades NV said on Monday it had acquired a dairy ingredients business from Cultor Food Science Inc in New York for $6.5 million.</p>
<p>The turnover of this business amounts to about $5 million, it said in a statement.  </p>
<p>Gist-Brocades said that no production facilities or employees were included in the transaction.</p>
<p>Gist-Brocades acquires the Surecurd/Suparen and Neutral Lactase products and cultures &amp; media for cheese production via the deal.</p>
<p>In 1995 net turnover of Gist-Brocades amounted to 1.84 billion guilders.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
